  <diagram id="erd7" name="Partners, audit and command log">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="1060" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Page 7 of 18. Business partners and banking (07, section 9), audit tables, command log (06) and read access log (09). Colours: yellow = versioned configuration (V, insert-only), blue = master data / current-state (M, row_version), red = append-only log (E), grey dashed = stub from another page. IAP = immutable after posting. Updated 2026-10-19: bank accounts without IBAN (ADR-223), signed package records and package items (ADR-196, ADR-217)." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
